{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.084,
            0.744,
            0.181
          ],
          "content": "**Be a reporter**: (i) Gather newspaper clippings and articles related to various methods of separation implemented in your society, such as in agricultural fields or at construction sites. (ii) Conduct interviews with local farmers to explore the latest agricultural separation methods that they use."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.216,
            0.729,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": "**Think like a scientist:** You are provided with a mixture of iron nails, sand, black pepper, stones, common salt and water. Which steps will you follow to separate each component of a mixture?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.3,
            0.657,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": "The given steps may help you to think like a scientist."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.336,
            0.338,
            0.509,
            0.357
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Reflection Steps"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.369,
            0.687,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": "I observe I wonder"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.399,
            0.679,
            0.419
          ],
          "content": "You might have wondered about questions such as—"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.426,
            0.617,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": " Which component should I separate first?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.451,
            0.655,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": " What method of separation should I use first?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.477,
            0.715,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": "How can we separate these components effectively?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.503,
            0.694,
            0.524
          ],
          "content": "Will some of the components be soluble in water?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.53,
            0.728,
            0.57
          ],
          "content": "What properties of the components can help us in their separation?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.577,
            0.6,
            0.597
          ],
          "content": "What is the most appropriate sequence?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.347,
            0.615,
            0.497,
            0.634
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Activity Steps"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.646,
            0.726,
            0.717
          ],
          "content": "Some possible answers to the questions which occurred in my mind are"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.73,
            0.727,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": "I performed the following methods of separation—"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.782,
            0.724,
            0.801
          ],
          "content": " My findings are"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.815,
            0.728,
            0.849
          ],
          "content": "Hint: A mixture that has more than two components requires a combination of several methods of separation."
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
          "bbox": [
            0.874,
            0.755,
            0.914,
            0.868
          ],
          "content": "in Everyday Life Methods of Separation"
        },
        {
